--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 85cd55c6b0955304c90bc3c8ea81e738, type: 3}
  m_Name: 4bONU
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::FullSceneDialogue
  dialogueLinesInOrder:
  - line: 
    duration: 2
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 0
  - line: All our models are predicting a lack of all global resources within the
      next fifty years.
    duration: 6
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0.5
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 14
  - line: I was elected to keep my people fed and alive, <3> not to play nice while
      they are starving in the streets !
    duration: 7
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 13
  - line: "My country may not have the resources to sustain ourselves, <3> but we
      have the manpower and technology to make sure we\u2019ll get the last of it
      !"
    duration: 7
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0.5
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 13
  - line: 'At this point, <2>fighting a war is useless. '
    duration: 5
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 12
  - line: The only thing we would achieve is pain and suffering upon those that would
      survive.
    duration: 6
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 12
  - line: 'What I propose may be drastic, <2> but it might be the only way for humanity
      to endure, <3> one way or another. '
    duration: 8
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 12
  - line: 'What I propose may be drastic, <2> but it might be the only way for humanity
      to endure, <3> one way or another. '
    duration: 8
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0.5
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 12
  - line: 'What you propose is madness ! '
    duration: 3
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 13
  - line: 'Reversing the course of society now is not a viable option : it <3> would
      require so many sacrifices; <2> technological and human !'
    duration: 8
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0.5
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 13
  - line: "The current population is only degrading our earth, <3>without action
      we\u2019re gonna destroy ourselves and our habitat with it."
    duration: 7
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 12
  - line: "The current population is only degrading our earth, <3>without action
      we\u2019re gonna destroy ourselves and our habitat with it."
    duration: 7
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 12
  - line: We need to stop all human activity as quickly as possible.
    duration: 5
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0.5
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 12
  - line: We simply have no other choice.
    duration: 3
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0.5
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 12
  - line: "It doesn\u2019t matter, <2> we won\u2019t let ourselves lose control."
    duration: 5
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0.5
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 0
    voice: 13
  - line: //END// (x4)
    duration: 6
    delayBeforeNextLine: 0
    backgroundFadeAwayOnEnd: 1
    voice: 0
